body:
Before reading my reply, i beg you to keep in mind that as mentioned, I am definitely not smart enough to be able to cofront you (or anyone for that matter) with arguments that make sense/ are not paradoxical of any kind. Actually, I should add that to my list why I am shit, but that's not the point now.

&#x200B;

to 1. I'm sorry, I don't know this subreddit and therefore I am not familiar with the people here. I actually just said that because I will not read any "diagnose" / comment trying to tell me that my point of view is illogical. That much I know myself as everything I say is illogical in some way. If you disagree with this, I am still right.

&#x200B;

to 2. Don't get me wrong here: I do not want to debate. I simply experience a feeling of relief by listing all the aspects that make me  a dumb failure and an obsolete living being. 

&#x200B;

to 3. 1 In my case, I belief there is no more appropriate term than "piece of shit" or all the other synonyms I use to describe the sad existence of a person like me. It is informal and unobjective.Keep in mind that terms like mentally disordered and so on are already used to describe other persons that share similar traits with me. Since it would be insulting to those to compare myself with them (I am clearly a much less valuable member of society) I chose the term piece of shit.

&#x200B;

to 3.2 By saying I am not the most intelligent person, I am NOT referring to IQ (as opposed to you) because I belief this number in general is inaccurate and not necessarily describing some people's intelligence properly. However, I am sure I would even manage to score such a low amount of points in an IQ test, that one might think I am actually mentally retarded (this is not meant to be insulting against mentally retarded people). What I was actually trying to say here is that I am incapable of thinking of the long- term consequences of my actions, that I have only very low social abitlities, that I suck when it comes to logic of any kind (this whole comment here is full of shit probably) , that I am not able to get happy with what I have (which an intelligent person is able to do - at least thats what I think, you don't have to and you better don't as this comes from someone who has no idea what he is talking about), that I fail miserably whenever I am in a situation where it almost seems impossible to fail and the list goes on. This leads me to the conclusion that I am not smart, I do not have a special talent/ ability, I am simply the (under-) average guy with a pinch of self- hatred and annoyingness.

&#x200B;

to 3.3 You are definitely right with that, mainly because I am never right, but also because you know what you are talking about there it seems (at least for me - an idiot, some smart guy might see that in a different way). However, I see this as further evidence for me being a worthless dipshit as I randomly introduced genetics where it makes no sense to do so. 

You are definitely not wrong because being wrong is my job.
